{"3478870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GeoGuessr Steam Edition", "steam_appid": 3478870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Steam Pass</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478870/extras/7158b306f405c32768470e2642bf90d9.avif?t=1778244984\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478870/extras_big/7158b306f405c32768470e2642bf90d9.webp?t=1778244984 width=1560 height=1680 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World Without Leaving Your Seat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GeoGuessr drops you somewhere on Earth and challenges you to figure out where you are. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using visual clues, intuition, and a bit of curiosity, you’ll navigate real world locations captured in street level imagery, turning every guess into a journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From quiet rural roads to bustling city streets, every round is a chance to discover something new. Study road signs, architecture, bollards, and fauna that reveal where you might be. The closer your guess, the higher your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills against other players around the world, where every guess counts and every second matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re competing or exploring at your own pace, each game sharpens your instincts and expands your view of the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a geography enthusiast or just love the thrill of discovery, GeoGuessr offers a unique way to experience the world, one location at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>General notes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a GeoGuessr browser subscription does not grant you full access to the GeoGuessr Steam Edition<strong>, </strong>unless you have an <strong>Unlimited </strong> or <strong>Elite </strong>monthly/yearly subscription. Nor does a GeoGuessr Steam Pass grant you access to the GeoGuessr browser version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GeoGuessr Steam Pass holders will be able to cross-play against GeoGuessr browser subscribers and vice versa.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World Without Leaving Your Seat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GeoGuessr drops you somewhere on Earth and challenges you to figure out where you are. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using visual clues, intuition, and a bit of curiosity, you’ll navigate real world locations captured in street level imagery, turning every guess into a journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From quiet rural roads to bustling city streets, every round is a chance to discover something new. Study road signs, architecture, bollards, and fauna that reveal where you might be. The closer your guess, the higher your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills against other players around the world, where every guess counts and every second matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re competing or exploring at your own pace, each game sharpens your instincts and expands your view of the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a geography enthusiast or just love the thrill of discovery, GeoGuessr offers a unique way to experience the world, one location at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>General notes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a GeoGuessr browser subscription does not grant you full access to the GeoGuessr Steam Edition<strong>, </strong>unless you have an <strong>Unlimited </strong> or <strong>Elite </strong>monthly/yearly subscription. Nor does a GeoGuessr Steam Pass grant you access to the GeoGuessr browser version.</p>